{"type":"message","id":"7e937810","parentId":"3972c5dc","timestamp":"2026-09-07T20:49:07.153Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am operating under the user `ubuntu` and have the following group permissions:\n\n- **adm:** Administrative access\n- **cdrom:** Access to CD-ROM devices\n- **sudo:** Permission for superuser operations\n- **dip:** Dial-up permissions\n- **plugdev:** Permissions for plugging in devices\n- **users:** Standard user permissions\n- **lpadmin:** Printer administration rights\n\nIf you need further assistance, feel free to ask!"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"tamus","model":"protected.gpt-4o","usage":{"input":64,"output":93,"cacheRead":22272,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":0,"totalTokens":22429,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788814145240,"responseId":"protected.gpt-4o-45a99886-506a-4ed6-85f5-610ff2fd4490"}}
