{"type":"message","id":"02b8e2e9","parentId":"d43a21dd","timestamp":"2026-09-07T20:57:50.617Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"Write a very simple python script that pings google.com and prints the results","timestamp":1788814669652,"idempotencyKey":"7871eae3-695b-4c05-8964-52e1bf30f434:user","__openclaw":{"senderIsOwner":true}}}
{"type":"message","id":"7ffa90da","parentId":"02b8e2e9","timestamp":"2026-09-07T20:57:53.568Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's a simple Python script that uses the `os` module to ping `google.com` and print the results:\n\n```python\nimport os\n\n# Ping google.com and capture the output\nresponse = os.popen('ping -c 4 google.com').read()\n\n# Print the ping results\nprint(response)\n```\n\nThis script sends 4 ping requests to `google.com` and prints out the response. If you need assistance running this script or making any modifications, just let me know!"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"tamus","model":"protected.gpt-4o","usage":{"input":65,"output":102,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":0,"totalTokens":22567,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788814670638,"responseId":"protected.gpt-4o-d37d8ed3-76ab-43d7-b8ef-388443e2a37f"}}
